    "**开启代理 TUN 模式**：确保 `*.googleapis.com` 长连接（HTTP/2、gRPC）正常转发": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Enable proxy TUN mode**: Ensure `*.googleapis.com` persistent HTTP/2 and gRPC connections forward properly"
          }
