    "**检查电脑麦克风**：系统麦克风权限已开启，默认录音设备正常且未被占用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Check Mac microphone**: System microphone permission is granted and the default input device is active"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**检查电脑麦克风**：系统麦克风权限已开启，默认录音设备正常且未被占用"
          }
        }
